# IPv4 destinations the relay refuses, one prefix per line. The NixOS module
# renders this same file into the relay service's IPAddressDeny= (comments and
# blank lines stripped), and HAProxy reads it through `-m ip -f`.
#
# Host and loopback, LAN/management/storage/VPN/cluster, carrier NAT,
# link-local and cloud metadata, special/multicast/reserved, plus the
# deprecated 6to4 relay anycast prefix.
0.0.0.0/8
10.0.0.0/8
100.64.0.0/10
127.0.0.0/8
169.254.0.0/16
172.16.0.0/12
192.0.0.0/24
192.0.2.0/24
192.88.99.0/24
192.168.0.0/16
198.18.0.0/15
198.51.100.0/24
203.0.113.0/24
224.0.0.0/4
240.0.0.0/4
